5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I worry about external factors. Let’s check the winter road closures and supplier delivery windows.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I care about access. I’ll look at bus links in the outer wards and evening room bookings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I need to see the funding shape. I’ll review the county grant terms and last year’s running lines.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know what failed before. I’ll check the two programmes begun six years ago and attendance sheets.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about staff skills. I’ll look at the volunteer register and neighbourhood associations.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if the grant ends, do we have the cash flow to keep the lights on?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
