14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I hope we have the people to run them. I’m a bit nervous about the workload.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll stick to my choices. The weather and suppliers are the biggest risks I see.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I’ll stick to my choices. If the bus stops, the service stops. It’s that simple.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I’ll stick to my choices. The money has to last beyond the first year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll stick to my choices. History repeats itself if we don’t look at the records.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll stick to my choices. We need to know who is actually qualified to help.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let’s see what the data says. I’m ready to move on.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m excited to see if the outer wards are truly cut off.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I trust the numbers will show the truth about the budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
