35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The roads closed eleven days, but suppliers slip when big clients book first. That’s a risk.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The outer wards lost their bus link. An hour’s round trip is too long for most people.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The grant only covers twelve months. After that, the flat budget carries the cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The old digitisation project failed, but the partner-run groups still meet. That’s a good sign.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"There are retired tradespeople volunteering, but no one on payroll is trained to supervise them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if the grant ends, can we afford the ongoing costs?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, yes, but only if we reach the people who need us most.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, reaching people is hard if the money runs out.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, the partner groups prove that community-led work can sustain itself.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, that’s true, but we still need someone to manage the volunteers safely.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’m concerned about the supplier delays. We need a plan that doesn’t rely on them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I’m worried about the bus links. We need to go to the people, not wait for them.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,I’m worried about the budget gap. We need a low-cost option.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,I’m glad the partner groups worked. We should build on that success.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about the supervision gap. We need to train someone or hire help.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let’s focus on options that are resilient to external delays.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,Let’s focus on options that reach the outer wards.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,Let’s focus on options that fit the long-term budget.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,Let’s focus on options that have a track record of success.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,Let’s focus on options that don’t overwhelm our current staff.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
